Pledge coin configuration parameter for set-account-level API

This is an API request parameter used to update pledge (collateral) coin settings.
It supports two forms:
- "all" type: Enable/disable pledge for all currencies
- "custom" type: Enable/disable pledge for specific currencies

# Examples

```ignore
// All currencies
let all_config = PledgeCoinConfigParam::all(true);
// Serializes to: {"type": "all", "collateralEnabled": true}

// Custom currencies
let custom_config = PledgeCoinConfigParam::custom(true, vec!["BTC".to_string(), "ETH".to_string()]);
// Serializes to: {"type": "custom", "ccyList": ["BTC", "ETH"], "collateralEnabled": true}
```
